# Japan local war terrain: 1 km and 500 m levels and manifest.json are distributed; finer levels,
# real rivers and their manifest stay local (scripts/bakeJapanLocalDem.mjs, scripts/bakeJapanRivers.mjs;
# hashes in docs/analytics/japan-local-dem-files-*.md)
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-local/*-250m*.bin
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-local/*-100m*.bin
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-local/rivers.json
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-local/manifest.local.json
# Terrain tiles finer than 500 m are not distributed (docs/plan/japan-terrain-tiles.md)
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-tiles/z4.bin
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-tiles/z5.bin
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-tiles/z6.bin
/public/heightmaps/earth/japan-tiles/index.local.json
